			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodule for IPC handler standardization\n\nUpdate the Element git submodule from 086cbf4 to 05ecea8 to integrate centralized macro utilities and parameter extraction helpers into the Mountain native backend.\n\n**Mountain:** Implement the `effect!` macro within `MappedEffectType` to streamline async-to-`MappedEffect` conversion. Introduce `Utilities::Params` to provide type-safe, default-aware extractors (`string_at`, `u64_at`) for `serde_json::Value` payloads. Apply these across the `Track/Effect/CreateEffectForRequest` tree (covering `Authentication`, `FileSystem`, `Terminal`, `WindowUI`, and `Workspace`) and refactor `WindServiceHandlers` to adopt the new `call!` macro.\n\nThis eliminates repetitive boilerplate, enforces consistent parameter extraction patterns, and aligns the IPC layer with Effect-based architectural principles.",
			"SHA": "4e8699f466aea71f22df02b865ceb73945d55068"
		},
